Display config (admin timestamps)
  APP_TIMEZONE=Asia/Kolkata
  APP_TIME_FORMAT=DD/MM/YYYY h:mm A   (dayjs: dd/mm/yyyy plus time)
  Used by GET /config/display for admin UI (Schedulers, etc.).

---
Custom query from jobs (alarm workflow)
  When job runs on API (local worker): executes query directly, no PAT needed.
  When job runs on remote worker: set CUSTOM_QUERY_PAT=nvpat_... for HTTP auth.

---
Job Scheduler (optional)
  When ENABLE_SCHEDULER=true (default), the API starts background scheduler and workers.
  Env: ENABLE_SCHEDULER, SCHEDULER_INTERVAL, SCHEDULER_FETCH_LIMIT, WORKER_COUNT, WORKER_CONCURRENCY,
       QUEUE_MAX_SIZE, DEFAULT_JOB_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, DEFAULT_JOB_MAX_RETRIES,
       WORKER_MEMORY_LIMIT_MB, SERVER_MEMORY_LIMIT_MB.
  Submit jobs via POST /jobs (template name + payload). Status: GET /jobs/{id}.